  "prompt": "Which stores were open on 1 January 2025? A store was open that day when its opened_on date is on or before 1 January 2025 and it had not closed yet: its close_date is missing (NULL) or later than 1 January 2025. A store with no opened_on date recorded (NULL) cannot be confirmed as open, so leave it out. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, opened_on, close_date. Return one row per store. Any row order is fine.",
